        },
        {
          "text": " Nelotu Nebukadnesa olaiguanani le Babilon agilunore ninye, neen ninye too lpisia neya ninye Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etanapa sii apa Nebukadnesa aya kulie tokitin e nkaji o Laitoriani Babilon, nepik ninche atua enkaji e nkitoo o laiguanani te Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa nkulie kiaasin e Yehoiakim o nena tokitin o ilo minong otaasa ninye, o mbaa torrok naaipirta ninye, ng'ura eigeroki tiatua embuku oo laiguanak le Israel o le Yuda. Neitoreisho Yehoiakin olayioni lenye terishata enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.8"
            ]
          }
        }
