        },
        {
          "text": " Eisero apa Sedekia apaashare olaiguanani Nebukadnesa, laa ninye apa oishoo ninye meinosa olmumai tialo Enkai; negolong'u ninye neitagol oltau lenye, neany eibelekenyakino Olaitoriani Enkai e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilapolosak pooki kituaak, oltung'ana sii neponari aaku ilemeisiligayu, nesuj olminong le lelo oshon; neisarkionie enkaji o Laitoriani, apa naitisinya ninye te Yerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Olaitoriani Enkai oo loo menye, neirriwaki ninche ilkiliku aimunye isinkan lenyena, enkaraki naing'urrie ninye iltung'ana lenyena, o tenkaraki emanyisho enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etigirate ninche aamor lelo sinkan le Nkai, nemenaa irorei lenyena, nesurdaay iloibonok le Nkai, o metaba anaa nedumunye engoro o Laitoriani too iltung'ana lenyena, ometaba anaa neaku meetae olmairo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
