              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.21.1+JER.21.2+JER.21.3+JER.21.4+JER.21.5+JER.21.6+JER.21.7+JER.21.8+JER.21.9+JER.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 21.1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.34.1+JER.34.2+JER.34.3+JER.34.4+JER.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34.1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore enkaraki ina neyau aitaar ninche olaiguanani loo Lkaldayo ilo apa otasesekuana ilbarnot lenye metuata tiatua enkaji e Nkai, nemeetayie olng'ur olbarnoti anaa esila, anaa oltung'ani kitok aashu oltung'ani moruo. Neishooyo ninche apik atua enkaina enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore nena masaa pooki e nkaji e Nkai nkutiti o sapuki, o lchumat pooki le nkaji o Laitoriani o lchumat lo laiguanani o lkituaak lenyena, neyai nena pooki Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepejoo ninche enkaji e Nkai neuroo esuntai e Yerusalem, nepejoo nkajijik enyena pooki e nkitoo te nkima. Neinyal nena tokitin pooki e tipat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eewa ninye eyararoto meshomo Babilon lelo apa ooilanya olalem, neaku isinkan lenyena, o metaba anaa neitasheyieki enkitoria e Parsia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.25.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 25.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.29.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "29.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Pee eitabari ororei lo Laitoriani oimua enkutuk e Yeremia, o metaba anaa neshipakino enkop sabato. Ore te nena olong'i pooki naitomijoonoki, neibung sabato neitabaya ilarin ntomoni naapishana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eitanapa Sairos Ilyahudi metushukunye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa to lari le dukuya le nkitoria olaiguanani Sairos le Parsia, pee etumi aaitabai ororei lo Laitoriani oimunyeki enkutuk e Yeremia, neputu Olaitoriani oltau le Sairos olaiguanani le Parsia, neaku etolimuo aibalunye te nkitoria enye pooki, neiger sii ajo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 44.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Nji ejo Sairos olaiguanani le Parsia, ‘Ore Olaitoriani Enkai e keper, naaisho nanu nkitoriat pooki enkop, naaitanap ninye nanu pee ashetaki ninye enkaji te Yerusalem. Aa taa te Yuda. Ore pooki ng'ae tiatua intae, te kulo tung'ana pooki nchoo eaku Olaitoriani Enkai enye tenebo ninye, nchoo ninye eilep alo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
